2:T536,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is an AI planner app?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An AI planner app is a software application that uses artificial intelligence algorithms to automatically create, time-block, and optimize your daily schedule based on your specific goals, available hours, and energy peaks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does AI-driven scheduling work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI scheduling analyzes your tasks and deadlines using large language models (LLMs), generates a realistic time-blocked timetable, and dynamically reschedules missed tasks in real-time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is PlanBot free to use on Android?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. PlanBot includes a 100% free tier on Android with daily AI plan generation, routine tracking, and focus statistics. Advanced upgrades start at ₹99/month (Pro) to ₹249/month (God tier)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is an AI planner better than a traditional to-do list?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Traditional to-do lists only store static tasks without estimating duration or managing time. AI planners automate schedule generation, allocate realistic focus windows, and eliminate daily decision fatigue."}}]}a:["slug","what-is-ai-planner-app-complete-guide","d"]
